00:03:28.422 --> 00:03:29.255
You know.

00:03:30.524 --> 00:03:32.110
Everyone has a personal brand,

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.833
but having a successful personal brand

00:03:33.833 --> 00:03:35.213
is very different.

00:03:35.213 --> 00:03:37.553
- [Interviewer] So your first step would

00:03:37.553 --> 00:03:39.615
be to know your role basically.

00:03:39.615 --> 00:03:41.077
