00:03:42.658 --> 00:03:44.828
you have something to add.

00:03:44.828 --> 00:03:48.092
So you need to figure that out.

00:03:48.092 --> 00:03:52.587
- [Interviewer] Okay, so a
lot of entrepreneurs look at

00:03:52.587 --> 00:03:55.187
someone like you and me you
know you kept on pushing.

00:03:55.187 --> 00:03:56.260
